# Knex SQL

Add schema only as `YYYYMMDDHHMMSS_short_name.js` under `apps/api/migrations`. College-scoped tables include `tenant_id` not null and index `(tenant_id, id)`.

Use Knex bindings. Production only moves forward: fix a bad migration with a new file. `migrate:rollback` is local and CI only.

```js
// BAD
table.string("email");
// GOOD
table.uuid("id").primary();
table.uuid("tenant_id").notNullable().index();
```
